{
 "format": "dpmg-mission/1",
 "name": "Ground to payload RX chain: G40-AX35 keys, G40-AX3G decodes",
 "notes": "Cable G40-AX35 TRx1B to the payload antenna port (T/R switch J0). G40-AX35 keys 9 comm waveforms in turn at TX attenuation 30 dB, 13 s each. G40-AX3G decodes each on TRx1A through the payload RX chain: switch, RX attenuator at 60 dB, LNA, splitter. Times count from Run mission; the first waveform starts at 00:01:05. The last one ends at 00:04:18. Estimated level: -20 dBm at J0, -87 dBm at the LNA, -64 dBm at G40-AX3G. Nothing keys on the payload in this plan. The payload must not key while G40-AX35 is on the antenna port: the HPA output would go into G40-AX35. Keep G40-AX35 at 10 dB TX attenuation or more on this cable.",
 "authorization": {
  "reference": "FLIGHT-2026-11",
  "note": "cabled: ground G40 TX jack to the payload antenna port, no antenna, the payload does not key"
 },
